OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy mist and fog initially
OL,6,Fbut turning to a fine afternoon with
OL,7,Fvariable cloud and sunny spells,
OL,8,Falthough some hill fog may linger over
OL,9,Fthe Derbyshire hills through the
OL,10,Fmorning. Light winds. Remaining
OL,11,Frelatively mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with clear
OL,14,Fspells leading to widespread mist and
OL,15,Ffog developing overnight, particularly
OL,16,Fthrough Lincolnshire. Light winds.
OL,17,FTemperatures mostly around average,
OL,18,Fbut turning chilly in clearer rural
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,168,160,301,260,100,100
